window.products.push({"id":83017,"name":"Portable Washing Homdox 17.8Lbs Portable Washer Machine with Drain Pump 1.92Cu.ft Capacity Full-Automatic Washer,with 10 Programs 8 Water Level Select","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RLzQ0YWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"▲【17.8 lbs Portable Washer 】 With a 1.92 Cu.ft. tub that washes up to 17.8 lbs.of laundry in 15-52 minutes.This washing machine with compact and lightweight design is ideal for space saving in your Vacation/RV/Home/Apartment. It's easily stored or moved in small spaces, & connects to a faucet with the INCLUDED drain hose & sink adapter. The Full-Automatic spin wash makes it easy to operate.This mini washer which has an easy to use LED digital display panel. ▲【Two-in-one fully automatic washing machine and dehydration combination】Fully automatic system, equipped with a single cylinder & drain pump, the washing machine can not only be used to wash clothes, but also can be used to shake off clothes moisture. And washing and dehydration can be used separately,You only need to set the washing/spinning program, and then it can work alone. ▲【Easy to operate】 The washing machine has ten programs, eight water level options and an LED display. All functions and operations are clearly listed, including water level/rotation, program/delay, time setting and child lock, detergent and program selection.You can select the appropriate programs and water level according to different cloth. Equipped with a faucet adapter to meet the needs of the faucet interface. ▲【Automatic imbalance detection (AUD)】It can automatically repair imbalance problems.While spinning, if the laundries inside the tub are not put equally, it would cause violent vibration.If the vibration exceeds a certain level, the imbalance adjustment function of our washing machine will automatically start to adjust the imbalance. ▲【Smart Delay and Child Lock & Customer Service】This portable washing machine has a 2-24 hour smart delay cleaning function. You can preset the washing start time according to your needs. In addition, the washing machine also has a child lock function. Once the lock function is set, all buttons will be locked.We provide a 2 year warranty, if you have any problems with your portable washer, you can contact us at any time. ▲【 Package Contents】All accessories you need are contained in the package, you will get 1 x portable full-automatic washing machine, 1 x drain hose(build-in), 1 x inlet hose, 1 x faucet adapter(US Standard size), 1 x bottom cover, lint filter, 1 x user manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RLzQ0YWrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homdox","source_asin":"B0BQLPX1WP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQLPX1WP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQLPX1WP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
