window.products.push({"id":83049,"name":"GOLDTONE Reusable No.4 Cone Style KRUPS Reusable Coffee Filter Replaces Your F0494210 Permanent Coffee Filter for KRUPS Machines and Brewers (2 Pack C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619Ei3iacHL._AC_SL1320_.jpg","description":"This #4 filter replaces KRUPS coffee filters 049-33 and F0494210. Start your day off right with a perfect cup of coffee! And while you’re at it, replace wasteful paper filters with GoldTone's eco-friendly reusable filters! You’ll be able to revamp your brew to upgrade the coffee flavor. Unlike paper filters, our filters do not cause loss of fragrant oils or coffee ground remnants that could ruin your fresh brew. Our mesh filters let the flavor flow through differently than traditional paper filters. It will leave you wondering why you didn’t make the switch to reusable filters sooner! Our GoldTone reusable filters are crafted precisely with surgical-grade stainless steel and are a must-have for every coffee lover. Coffee drinkers in the United States dispose of over 200 million paper coffee filters each day. That’s enough paper filters to fill a 19-story building. These paper filters end up in landfill sites. Every day, it takes over 11,000 trees to make all these paper filters. That’s 30,000 acres of forest per day! With this product, you’ll never have to buy a paper filter again, saving money in the long run while also reducing waste. Having a permanent filter around will also save you the aggravation of discovering you are out of paper filters while you are getting your day started. With our pour-over model, you don’t even need an expensive coffee maker for the perfect cup. GoldTone has been meeting the world's filtration needs since 1992. We are the largest manufacturer of reusable coffee filters in the world. Our company ensures our reliable filters are made with quality material. Here at GoldTone, we offer valuable service based on over 20 years of professional experience and expertise.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619Ei3iacHL._AC_SL1320_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoldTone","source_asin":"B08SJFGYCW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJFGYCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJFGYCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
