window.products.push({"id":83054,"name":"Unifit Tumble Dryer Internal Condenser Inc Hose And Box Will Fit Hotpoint Creda Almost Any Dryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21UFcLfs9tL._AC_.jpg","description":"Please note this product works on science, there are no moving parts - the hot air hits the cold water and condenses. For it to work effectively it needs some ventilation in the room and the water in the unit needs to be as cold possible (ice would help) and may require changing during heavy use. It is recommended to not leave the unit unattended until you have established the effectiveness of the unit on your dryer. Usage Instructions: Simply attach the 1.5m (4in) exhaust hose (supplied) to the steam outlet on your dryer, add some (1.5in) cold (the colder the better, iced water will help) water to the unit and that's it. All the moisture/steam from the drying process is fed into the special re-useable container, which you empty after each use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21UFcLfs9tL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Europart","source_asin":"B001FUWI4A","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83054","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001FUWI4A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001FUWI4A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":83055,"name":"Frigidaire EFIC229_AMZ Igloo ICE105 Counter Top Compact Ice Maker, Stainless, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZjcpcJy1L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you hear the Frigidaire name, immediately you think of quality built, affordable kitchen products. Well the folks at Frigidaire are at it again. Introducing the ICE105, Counter Top Ice Maker!  Are you hosting a party? Well then you better get your hands on this ice maker! The sleek stainless steel look combined with the LED design that allows you to check the ice level and choose the size of ice cubes you want, is all you could dream of in an ice machine. The cover with the large see through window makes it easy to see the ice basket and shovel. The air outlet will keep this thing going through the whole party and when it’s time to clean up you can easily empty the ice maker with the drain plug. All this from the makers at Frigidaire, the #1 leader in refrigeration!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZjcpcJy1L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FRIGIDAIRE","source_asin":"B081ZMYCVM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83055","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081ZMYCVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B081ZMYCVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
