window.products.push({"id":83057,"name":"Upgraded S-Union 1 Pack MP21YA 8\" Electric Range Burner Element, Stove Burners Replacement for Hardwick & Kenmore & Maytag & Norge & Whirlpool Electri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kiEIpztpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Compatibility】This stove burner is fit for most ranges. Reminder: It does not fit for GE and Hotpoint. If you select the wrong burner set, it will not fit your stove. If you are not sure whether the product is compatible with your stove, please feel free to contact us, we will help you confirm it. Replace part number: WPY04100166, 4381750, Y0E00801799, 400178, 19950009, 1938-344, 1938-249, 15928, 0E00801799, 04100166, SU306, MP26YA, MP26M, MP21U, MP21MA, 7406P050-60, 74005447, 715928, 715928, 707457, 707457, 7-7457, 7-15928, 550072, 550072, 5-50072, Y04100166, AP6024131, PS11757481, EAP11757481, 1242502, PD00003012. 【High Quality Stove Burner】This stove burners replacement for whirlpool heats up quickly during the use, which could save energy. It is made of high quality material with large resistivity, small temperature coefficient of resistance, low deformation at high temperature and is not easy to embrittle, which is steady and durable to use. Tested by manufacturer to match and exceed specifications of OEM products. 【Reminder】This stove burner replacement set will not fit GE and Hotpoint. When buying that please make sure your “Y” Size can match ours, otherwise this product may not fit your drip pans. And the new stove burner has a layer of protect coating on it, which is used to protect the surface. When using the item for the first time, the protect coating will volatilize with the high temperature, it maybe has a little smog, which is normal because it is caused by the protective layer of the new burner element. Customer continue to use the product for about 20 minutes, and there will be no more smoke when you use next time . 【Notice】Please check the dimensions of the stove burner as shown on the photos to ensure they fit your stove before purchasing. If the stove burner does not sit flat on your stove, please make sure the connection bolts are parallel and pushed a bit down. 【What you get】 1 * MP21YA 8\" Electric Range Burner Element- 2100 Watt 230V. We provide 18-month warranty and guarantee you the best service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kiEIpztpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"S-Union","source_asin":"B07ML3SBW3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83057","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ML3SBW3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ML3SBW3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
