window.products.push({"id":83124,"name":"Iceman Dual-Size Countertop Ice Machine, Portable Ice Maker Machine, Creates 2 Cube Sizes in 6 Mins, Holds 1.3 lb. of Ice, Makes up to 26 lb. in 24 Ho","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KWWE00QNL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Iceman Dual-Size Ice Machine is your ice making countertop companion. With two ice sizes to choose from, you can have ice when and where you want. Display lights indicate when ice-making is complete, when the water to make ice is low, or when the cleaning cycle has been completed. The included ice basket holds 1.3 lb. of ice, and the top viewing window helps you see how much ice is left. The 5 ft. power cord and cooler-style drain plug simplify setup and take down. Plastic serving scoop and removable ice basket included. Purchase includes a 1-year assurance from Chefman by Iceman For information on how to use your product, scroll down for a PDF User Guide. 120 Volts/1.7 Amps. RJ56-D1 Ice Basket Stores 1.3 lb. of Ice •Makes Large or Small Round Ice  •Detachable Carry Handle  •Indicator Lights  •Top Viewing Window  •Bottom Drain Outlet  •Long 5 ft Power Cord  •Plastic Scoop Included¬¬¬","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71KWWE00QNL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B0C49YTRKQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C49YTRKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C49YTRKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":83125,"name":"Broan- NuTone BBN1243SS Custom Built Insert with 2-Speed Exhaust Fan and Light, 300 Max Blower CFM, Stainless Steel, 24-Inch Range Hood Power Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":249.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7138EQNhDvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Protect your cabinetry and keep your kitchen air clear and pure with the Broan-NuTone Custom Range Hood Insert. Perfect for custom kitchen designs and streamlined cabinet installations, this 24-inch one-piece insert protects the bottom of your cabinetry and looks great doing it- the flush design and depth adjustment capability make this stainless steel insert suitable for any kitchen appearance. This hood insert comes with EZ1 clips, making solo installation less daunting both for professional and DIY installers. This HVI certified range hood insert includes a two-speed rocker switch for convenience, and clears the air at a max blower speed of 300 CFM to remove smoke, grease, exhaust, and odor from your kitchen. This 11.44\" x 24\" x 2.81\" insert is ADA compatible, and works in tandem with an optional remote wall control (sold separately), as well as optional universal make-up air dampers. It is UL listed, cUL listed, and can be used in compliance with LEED requirements. Operating at 3 sones of noise, this insert is about as loud as a typical conversation, so you won't have to yell over the sound. Featuring bright, 1-level LED lighting, this custom built-in range hood insert power pack makes evening cooking accessible and easy. The smooth, stainless steel surface and quick-release dishwasher-safe aluminum mesh filters allow for easier cleaning, and an optional non-duct filter kit (sold separately) eliminates the need for strenuous ductwork.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7138EQNhDvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Broan-NuTone","source_asin":"B0C5YMKQPS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5YMKQPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5YMKQPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":83126,"name":"4 Water Filters (ion exchange) for BREVILLE coffee machine BWF100 - Premium, Compatible IONIZATION Filters - Replacement Water Filters for BWF-100 Cof","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gpbri5cfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"4 Premium Ion Exchange Filters for Breville Coffee Machines These Blue Signature Water Filters are only compatible model # BWF100 for the owners of the following Espresso Machines: the Oracle Touch (BES990 - Batch 1746 & earlier) the Oracle Touch (BES990 - Batch 1746 & earlier) the Oracle (BES980 - Batch 1813 & earlier) the Oracle (BES980 - Batch 1813 & earlier) the Barista Pro (BES878) the Barista Pro (BES878) the Barista Express (SES875 - Batch 1734 & earlier) the Barista Express (SES875 - Batch 1734 & earlier) the Barista Express (BES870) the Barista Express (BES870) the Infuser (BES840) the Infuser (BES840) the Duo-Temp Pro (BES810) the Duo-Temp Pro (BES810) the Dual Boiler (BES920 - Batch 1800 & earlier) Filters for Breville, CARBON vs. RESIN (Ion Exchange) - - - Two different filters for 2 different purposes - - - Activated charcoal (carbon) is to filter free-radical ions such as Chlorine, Fluorine, etc. Certain reactive chemicals also bind to activated charcoal. Said charcoal is the same ingredient used in hospitals and emergency rooms to bind drug overdoses. It's meant to bind reactive chemicals. These Resin filters, on the other hand, are meant for ions (i.e. cations, such as calcium, iron, magnesium, etc) and exchange it with a non-scaling ion most typically potassium. Ion-exchange resins, in summary, is better termed \"softener.\" Water softeners use ion-exchange resins. What makes water \"hard\" is those dissolved solids and most typically calcium (the white chalky stuff). You can only appreciate the difference depending on the original water quality. If your water is hard, you'll find more benefits using this Blue Signature ion-exchange filter to soften it up. If your water is odorus, such as chlorine taste, or sulfur taste from well water, you will find better benefits using Charcoal.  If your water can be considered standard, normal, which means it's soft (i.e. dissolved solid is low at 50 ppm or 100ppm), and generally clean (not heavily treated, low chlorine), then you won't find much additional benefits using either or both. the Dual Boiler (BES920 - Batch 1800 & earlier) Filters for Breville, CARBON vs. RESIN (Ion Exchange) - - - Two different filters for 2 different purposes - - - Activated charcoal (carbon) is to filter free-radical ions such as Chlorine, Fluorine, etc. Certain reactive chemicals also bind to activated charcoal. Said charcoal is the same ingredient used in hospitals and emergency rooms to bind drug overdoses. It's meant to bind reactive chemicals. These Resin filters, on the other hand, are meant for ions (i.e. cations, such as calcium, iron, magnesium, etc) and exchange it with a non-scaling ion most typically potassium. Ion-exchange resins, in summary, is better termed \"softener.\" Water softeners use ion-exchange resins. What makes water \"hard\" is those dissolved solids and most typically calcium (the white chalky stuff). You can only appreciate the difference depending on the original water quality. If your water is hard, you'll find more benefits using this Blue Signature ion-exchange filter to soften it up. If your water is odorus, such as chlorine taste, or sulfur taste from well water, you will find better benefits using Charcoal. If your water can be considered standard, normal, which means it's soft (i.e. dissolved solid is low at 50 ppm or 100ppm), and generally clean (not heavily treated, low chlorine), then you won't find much additional benefits using either or both.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71gpbri5cfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Signature","source_asin":"B07KCLQHBF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KCLQHBF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KCLQHBF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":83127,"name":"Deco Chef 44LB Countertop Nugget Ice Maker with 2.6LB Auto-Renew Basket and Automatic Cleaning, 1.8LB per Hour, First Batch in 10 Minutes, Stainless S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":319.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-5Qe1v6pL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOR THE DRINK AND COCKTAIL ENTHUSIAST - Sleek, efficient, and easy to use - the Deco Chef 44LB Nugget Ice Machine combines countertop proportions and high ice-making volume in a compact package. Simple controls and water fill methods come together to deliver delicious restaurant-quality ice when you want it. LOTS OF ICE, FAST - As the product name suggests, this ice maker is capable of creating and dispensing up to 44 pounds of ice per day. At a rate of 1.8 pounds of ice per hour get fresh, clear nugget ice in as little as 10 minutes depending on water and environment temperatures ALWAYS READY - In just 2.5 hours, this ice machine is full of ice ready to be stored in the 2.6-pound basket, in a separate freezer so more ice can be made, or immediately in your drink of choice. Plan to leave the ice in the machine for a while? No worries, the auto-renew basket collects meltwater and forms new ice cubes automatically. STAY IN THE KNOW - Know exactly what your ice maker is up to thanks to its forward-facing LCD display. Stay on top of when you need to add more water, knowing when the unit is full, or when it�s actively making ice. Simple touch controls control the ice maker, including when you want it to perform its automatic self-cleaning function. THE BENEFITS OF NUGGET ICE - For more than just cooling down your drink, nugget ice is a smaller cube-like ice that is softer to chew and absorbs the flavor of your drink. As you drink, enjoy flavorful and fun bites of ice that will want you to come back for more. Impress guests with cocktail-making skills without the hassle of ice cube trays and clunky cubes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-5Qe1v6pL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco Chef","source_asin":"B0C5F3D7VC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5F3D7VC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5F3D7VC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
