window.products.push({"id":83154,"name":"WED7500VW Electric Dryer with 3.8 cu. ft. Capacity, 11 Drying Cycles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xyxhi9ZOL._AC_SL1290_.jpg","description":"Lets face it doing laundry is one of the least appealing of domestic chores. You can either haul a back breaking load of laundry out to the Laundromat every week, or pay an outrageous amount to have someone do it for you .Either way is unappealing, you either strain your body like a pack mule, or pay through the nose just to have clean clothes. There is a solution that will save you money, and save your back. Whirlpool has an affordable space saving clothes dryer WED7500VW that will allow you to at least do half of your laundry chores in the comfort or you own home. And if you add the Whirlpool washer WFC7500VW, to the equation you can liberate yourself from the drudgery of doing the laundry outside of the home. Both units are affordable, compact in size. The dryer has moisture sensor control that measures the dampness of clothes as they tumble in the dryer. Sensors automatically turn off the cycle when clothes are dry. Stainless steel drum resists odors, rust and chipping and the smooth surface helps protect delicate fabrics from snagging. This compact dryer can be stacked with the compact washer to conserve every inch of floor space if needed. Features: Long Vent Exhaust Normal Cycle Timed Drying Damp Dry Cycle Extra-Large Front-Mounted Lint Screen Adjustable End-of-Cycle Signal Stack Kit W10178021A Included Does not include power cord","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xyxhi9ZOL._AC_SL1290_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B001A5F1XA","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001A5F1XA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B001A5F1XA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
