window.products.push({"id":83277,"name":"Beaquicy Washer Stainless Steel Hoses with 90 Degree Elbow - 4 Ft Long Red and Blue (2 Pack) Burst Proof - Hot and Cold Striped Water Supply Lines for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FuU63z2GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stainless Steel ✅【SAFETY AND DURABLE】:Stainless Steel Washer Supply Hose 4 Ft use true 304 stainless steel for braided outer protective cover , can effective protection against rust and leaking. 4 Ft Stainless Steel Washer Hoses has a 3/4-inch female hose thread connection, and the stainless washer hoses are equipped with 90-degree elbows on one end for an easy and smooth installation in tight spaces. Washing machine hot and cold water hoses fit for almost all washers. ✅ 【PRODUCT INCLUDES】:Each package includes two water supply line, 1 x Blue colored stainless hose for cold Water, 1 x Red colored stainless hose for hot water. Washer supply hoses are color-coded to ensure easy matching of hot-to-hot and cold-to-cold from the water supply faucet to the washing machine. 4 FT Washing machine stainless hose with a 90 degree elbow will work from 15° F - 158° F can be used in both high and low temperature environments. ✅【10 YEARS WARRANTY】:The 4 FT Washing Machine Hoses with 3/4\" 90-Degree Elbows supports 10 years return and exchange.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping,if you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time.We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【QUALITY PRODUCT】:The 4ft washer hoses are made with Lead free, Pvc core, Extra-thick Rubber washer, 100% pure rubber internal hose, ultra-high tensile strength braided stainless steel hoses, which can preventing water leaks kinking crimping and corrosion.Washing machine hot and cold water hoses can be easily connected to the ordinary household water supply line in the laundry room and solve the housework of laundry. ✅ 【CONVENIENCE INSTALLATION】:Unplug the washing machine and turn off the water supply before making any repairs.First remove the old hose from the water supply faucet, and screw the new stainless washer supply hoses to the water supply faucet.Then find the hot and cold water inlets on the washer, and hand-tighten the other end of the new water inlet hose to the corresponding water inlet of the washer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FuU63z2GL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087WH3MVB","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83277","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087WH3MVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087WH3MVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
