window.products.push({"id":83329,"name":"JOYGOAL Impulse Sealer Manual Sealing Machine 110V (8inch/200mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZLK2mGEeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1.Purpose This sealer is suitable to seal every kind of plastic films, and widely used in the fields such as food and sweet stuff, drags, native and special goods, electric appliance parts etc. It is easy-using and economical perfect sealing equipment for manufactures, stores and service industry.  2.Operation ①　This machine don’t use the power switch. Put the AC cord into 110V socket, according to the thickness of the materials to be sealed, regulate the heat time duration. Put the plastic bag on the sealing platform, then put down the handle. The electronic circuit controls the heat time automatically. Once the light turns off, the power is cut off automatically. About 1-2 seconds later, release the handle and the perfect seal is completed. ②　If the break or damage appears on the seal, it is because of the over-long heat time. Please regulate the heat time toward the directions for shorting time. ③　If the plastic bag sticks to the handle rubber, it is because the cooling time is not enough. Please prolong the cooling time after the light turns off, and release the handle late. ④　After regulating the heating time duration, please keep it unchanged in every use. Unnecessary to make any regulating for the continuous sealing. ⑤　The AC cord is surely plugged into the socket all the time, and it does not consume the power at all under non-use condition. 3.Specification Model: SF-200 Power source: 300W, 110V/60Hz Max sealing length: 200mm  Max sealing thickness: 0.3mm Max sealing idth: 2mm Healing time: 0.2-1.5s Weight: 1.8kg Size: 340*100*170mm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZLK2mGEeL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYGOAL","source_asin":"B07CSPJVBQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83329","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CSPJVBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CSPJVBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
