window.products.push({"id":83332,"name":"DC31-00054A Washer Drain Pump Water Motor Assembly (85 Watts 110 Volts)by Beaquicy - Replacement for Ken-more Sam-sung Washing machine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.87,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612YHw8P7SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS】:DC31-00054A Washer Drain Pump helps expel water from the washing machine,activated after the spin speed is maintained for a specific period of time during the spin cycle.The DC31-00054A washer drain pump sits at the back of your washer.It’s spec’d for Voltage: 120V-127V, Watts: 80W,Amps: 1.4A,Hertz: 60Hz.3600 rpm.The drain pump is constructed of sturdy and durable high-quality plastic, and the overall color is black and white. ✅【PRODUCT INCLUDES】:Includes 1 x DC31-00054A washer drain pump.Washing machine drain pump motor, includes impeller.Impeller is not available separately.When the propeller or motor of the drain pump is broken or the body is broken, your washing machine will not drain properly, or even leak, then you can replace Beaquicy's DC31-00054A Washer Drain Pump Motor to get your washing machine back to normal operation. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】: DC31-00054A Washing machine drain pump motor supports 365 days return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】:Washer drain pump motor DC31-00054A can replacement for Sam-sung,Ken-more and May-tag washing machine.Replaces for DC31-00016A, DC3100054A, 1534541, AP4202690, PS4204638, EAP4204638, WF328AAWXAA0000, WF328AAWXAA0001, WF328AAWXAA0002, WF350ANRXAA0000, WF331ANRXAA0004, WF328AARXAA0000, WF328AARXAA0001, WF328AARXAA0002, WF350ANWXAA0000, WF337AAWXAA, WF409ANWXAA, WF306BHW/XAA, WF316BAW/XAA, WF339AAW/XAA, etc. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】:Unplug the washer before installing this drain pump motor,and Wear work gloves to protect your hands.You need a philips screwdriver,a pair of long-angled pliers and a needle-nose pliers.Just beware that there are like 5 or 6 sets of screws that get removed,and the different sets are different sizes.To make sure that you line up the each set of screws in separate piles somewhere safe,so that the DC31-00054A drain pump motor can work normally when you put it all back together.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612YHw8P7SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B082W732T2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83332","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082W732T2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B082W732T2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
