window.products.push({"id":83388,"name":"2-Pack Colador De Cafe Flannel Cloth Filter - Reusable, Sustainable, and Easy to Use for Rich, Smooth Brews Experience Cuban Spanish-Style Coffee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Xww0i7owL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 2 Pack Spanish Coffee Filter Strainer Colador De Cafe Flannel Cloth Plastic Handle is a must-have for coffee enthusiasts who love a rich, smooth, and strong cup of coffee without the gritty grounds. These reusable coffee filter strainers come in a pack of two and are made with high-quality flannel cloth that provides a traditional Spanish-style brewing experience. The coffee filters are designed to fit perfectly in most coffee makers, and their compact size makes them easy to store when not in use. The plastic handle on the side of the filter allows for easy handling and prevents accidental burns while brewing. One of the best features of these coffee filters is their ability to provide a smooth, rich, and strong cup of coffee without any gritty grounds. The flannel cloth material used in these filters ensures that the coffee is filtered thoroughly, leaving behind only the pure and delicious coffee flavor. In addition to their superior performance, these coffee filters are also environmentally friendly and economical. They are reusable and can be easily washed, making them a cost-effective alternative to disposable paper filters. The 3.5-inch (9cm) size of these filters is ideal for brewing Cuban, Spanish, Turkish, and espresso coffee, among others. Their versatile use makes them perfect for any coffee lover, whether you prefer a strong cup of coffee or a milder brew. In summary, the 2 Pack Spanish Coffee Filter Strainer Colador De Cafe Flannel Cloth Plastic Handle is a must-have for anyone who loves a rich, smooth, and strong cup of coffee. Their simple design, easy-to-use features, and superior performance make them an excellent addition to any coffee lover's collection.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41Xww0i7owL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dependable","source_asin":"B06XRJYVL3","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XRJYVL3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XRJYVL3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
