window.products.push({"id":83524,"name":"1 Gallon 10\" X 14\" Mylar Bags - 20 Pack Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ypUGs0T7L.jpg","description":"When Purchased with buckets. * 10\"x14\" One Gallon 3.5 mil Thick Mylar Bag * Sealable With Hot Iron - Can Reseal After Opening * Perfect for Long Term Food Storage * Light, Moisture, Oxygen Barrier & Puncture Resistant * This One Gallon Size bag is perfect for storing Salt, Baking Soda/Powder and Spices * 5 Of this 1 Gallon Bags fit easly in a Five Gallon Bucket Product Description to 48 states In today's world of financial instability, food shortages, possible inflation, and rising commodity prices Long Term Food Storage must be considered by any prudent individual or family. Gallon Mylar bags, when combined with oxygen absorbers and buckets are considered the best way to store large quantities of food for 15 - 25 years. These Gallon Size Mylar bags filter sunlight and provide an additional oxygen and moisture barrier. To seal Gallon Metalic Poly Mylar bags simply take a hot iron and iron the opening shut. This package includes 20 - Gallon Size (10\"X14\") 3.5 Mil. thick Mylar Bags. These Gallon Size Mylar Bags are perfect for storing smaller quantities of food. Gallon sized bags are ideal for dried powered foods, spices, hard candy, salts, grains and other baking ingredients. These gallon size mylar bags will help protect valuables, ammo, and medical supplies from general corrosion that comes with varying weather and heat conditions over time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/21ypUGs0T7L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BayTec","source_asin":"B07B67SBGG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07B67SBGG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07B67SBGG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
