window.products.push({"id":83715,"name":"DC97-18094B Washer Door Boot Gasket Seal OEM Part Compatible with Samsung Washing Machines Replaces AP5917067, PS9606239, 4000547, 1 Year Warranty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":30.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712DqthqPcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description and Advice This door boot seal is a genuine part, sold individually. This door boot seal can be used as a replacement part for washing machine. This part seals the inside of the washing machine, preventing leaks. The most common symptom of damage to a door boot seal is a leak during a typical dishwasher cycle; If the leak's source seems to be in the general location of the door boot seal, the door boot seal should be visually inspected and assessed for damage. If damage is visible to the naked eye, the door boot seal should be removed and replaced with this genuine OEM replacement part as soon as possible to prevent future leakages. This is an OEM part sourced directly from the manufacturer.This door boot seal is compatible with Samsang washer that listing in the Fig 3. Problem Can Be Solved Listed： 1.Old door boot seal gasket was covered in dirty stuff. 2.Old door boot seal gasket would not clean off well. 3.Front loader leaking at the bottom of the door. Cross Reference and Model Information： Part Number DC97 18094B replaces AP5917067, 4000547, PS9606239. Works with All Washer Appliance Models Listed： WF42H5200AP/A2 01 WF42H5000AW/A2 00 WF42H5000AW/A2 01 WF42H5200AF/A2 00 WF42H5200AF/A2 01 WF42H5200AW/A2 00 WF42H5200AW/A2 01 WF42H5200AP/A2 00 WF42H5000AW/A2 11 WF42H5200AP/A2 11 WF42H5200AW/A2 11 WF42H5200AF/A2 WF42H5200AF/A2 11 Tip: When you open the package, you will find washer door boot gasket seal typically come in a kinked shape because of shipping and packing constraints. Two strategies help you remove the kinks: 1. Fill a tub with some hot water(about 150 F) and lay the gasket in it for up to 10 minutes. 2. Lay the treated door boot gasket on a table and carefully stretch the rubber into the shape for the door. Allow it to lay flat until you install it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712DqthqPcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hqsgdmn","source_asin":"B0B5367TCY","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5367TCY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5367TCY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
