window.products.push({"id":83782,"name":"W10780048 Washer Suspension Rods Kit [Upgraded] by Techecook - Fit for Whirlpool, Kenmore, Maytag Washing Machines - Replace W10349191, W10257087, W10","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IgJOjKkqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Strong and Durable ‎Stainless Steel ✅ 【ITEM SPECIALITY & DURABLE】---W10780048 Washer Suspension Rods Kit support the washing machine washing tub and balance the washing machine under unbalanced conditions to reduce vibration. If the washing machine loses the balance or code error, use the new suspension rod kit to keep the balance back to normal use. Our W10780048 ken-more washer suspension rods is high quality, durability and good price. The rods are coated to avoid potential rust problems. ✅ 【W10780048 SUSPENSION ROD KIT】--- Includes 4 x Suspension rods,4 x Suspension balls,4 x Suspension ball housing. ➤Length:23.6in. If one or more of the W10780048 Washer Suspension Rod Kit is broken, the washer will vibrate or shake. The unbalanced load error \"UL\" in cabrio style machines is often caused by faulty suspension. Please check and replace the suspension rod in time to help restrain the vibrate or shake of the washing machine tub. ✅ 【365-DAYS WARRANTY】---During the warranty period, if the RTW4640YQ1 roper suspension rod kit washing machine parts W10780048 Top Load Washer Suspension Rod Kit has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. If you are not satisfied with the product, please contact us immediately. ✅ 【COMPATIBLE MODEL】---The W10780048 rod spring assemblies Compatible with the Cros-ley caw9244bw0 parts, Whirl-pool wtw4800xq2, wtw4800xq4, May-tag, ken-more, Ro-per rtw4640yq1, Ad-miral atw4675yq1, Ken-more 11020022013, cab-rio Washing Machine. ► W10780048 Washer Directly Replaces part numbers：4185114, AP5971398, EAP11703290, PS11703290, W10257087, W10257088, W10349191, W10349193, W10748952, W10821948. ✅ 【DIY INSTALLATION】---Disconnect the power before installing this W10780048 Washing Machine Suspension Rods. Wear work gloves to protect your hands. You can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install Suspension rod W10780048. If you are not sure whether the Washer Suspension Rod Kit W10780048 fits your washers, please feel free to contact us to help you check.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IgJOjKkqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOMOON","source_asin":"B08N3XQDLD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83782","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08N3XQDLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08N3XQDLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":83783,"name":"BACOENG Double Faucet Door Mount Kegerator Refrigerator Conversion Kit No Tank","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ry5S-sQmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"1. DUAL GAUGE REGULATOR: It comes with an appropriate pressure dial that features the style of a knob for regulating pressure. With a weight of 3 pounds, the unit comes with rubber covers for protective purposes. You can use the gauge to know the pressure outside and inside the CO2 tank –you will not have to be worried that your gas might run out. It also has a shutoff valve that features a built-in spring for preventing the backflow of beer. Pressure Relief Valve Releases at 45PSI. 2. LEVER HANDLE KEG COUPLER: This refers to a D System Keg Coupler that has a strong construction made of nickel-plated forged brass. The probe, on the other hand, is made of stainless steel. The unit can be used alongside any domestic brand American D system Sankey kegs. It features an easy-to-use design, where you only need to pull the lever handle out and down, in that order, to couple the keg. The coupling of the keg is quite convenient with the availability of a 55-psi pressure relief valve 3. CHROME BEER FAUCET WITH BRASS LEVER: Featuring a forged brass body and highly polished chrome finish, this beer faucet puts a stylish finishing touch on your kegerator at a price you'll love.The brass shaft assembly and lever includes a non-stick ball washer for smooth operation, and the lever has standard threading that is compatible with most branded tap handles. This 4-1/8\" long beer shank with nipple assembly is constructed from chrome-plated brass and can be mounted through a 1\" hole. 4. METAL BEER FAUCET WRENCH: You need the ideal wrench spanner for loosening or tightening shrank collars easily and quickly without the worry that you will scratch your faucets, and the standard metal beer faucet wrench is just the right tool. The all-mental sturdiness of this wrench makes it quite durable as well as ideal to handle any tightening or loosening needs. It is 5-1/4\" in length, which makes it easy to use on any surface. 5. STANDARD METAL BEER FAUCET WRENCH: You need the ideal wrench spanner for loosening or tightening shrank collars easily and quickly without the worry that you will scratch your faucets, and the standard metal beer faucet wrench is just the right tool. The all-mental sturdiness of this wrench makes it quite durable as well as ideal to handle any tightening or loosening needs. It is 5-1/4\" in length, which makes it easy to use on any surface.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ry5S-sQmL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BACOENG","source_asin":"B07BVJZ5PP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83783","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BVJZ5PP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BVJZ5PP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
