window.products.push({"id":83927,"name":"Kiamitor Ultrasonic Washing machine, Ultrasonic Laundry, Mini Portable Small Washing Machine For Clothes Vegetable Underwear (silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ftDoj01GL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Technology Advantages  Through the role of ultrasound on the water, to bring fast cleaning clothes.  Through the ultrasonic air bombing,nano-ions prodiced in the water, relying on nano-ions clothing to achieve a comprehensive and lasting disinfection and sterilization.  Through the magnetization of water, reduce its density, activate the water cleaning process.  Keep the color and structure of the clothing  The whole process is safe and harmless  The maximum amount of water and electricity  Cost-effective,with the same cleaning effect, the cleaner power consumption is minimal. Compared to the traditional washing machine,it significant savings in water and electricity, reducing costs. Beautiful design, small, stylish, intelligent, technology, easy to carry,no need to worry about washing machine,no hurt the hand.   Working Principl  Its working principle is the use of ultrasonic high frequency into kinetic energy in the metallurgical medium, in the high-frequency vibration, the liquid to produce a small cavitation bubble and burst,the impact of the burst divorce the dirt of odject surface,so as to achieve the cleaning effect.   Precautions  Unplug the plug after using the product  Prohibit the use of water in more than 55 degrees  Do not plug the product into a power supply unless it is a specialist  Do not plug the product into power when you are unattended  Do not use the working end in the air or exposed to the surface  Do not use the product with damaged power cable or plug .  Do not touch the plug with a wet hand to prevent electric shock  Keep the product in a safe place to prevent it from being transferred to water or other liquids  When the product can not be used normally, please get the product to the designated repair shop for repair","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ftDoj01GL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kiamitor","source_asin":"B0788L4DHM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0788L4DHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0788L4DHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
