window.products.push({"id":83979,"name":"4 Pack Reusable Coffee Pod Coffee Filter for Ninja Coffee Maker, K Cup Reusable Pod Compatible with Ninja Dual Brew Pro Coffee Ninja CFP201 CFP301 Nin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xq1Ru7BVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Please Pay Attention to the Round Concave Structure! - We carefully analyzed the brewing head of this three-hole dualbrew coffee machine, and then designed this k cup reusable coffee filter with a concave top cover according to the actual model structure. The curved surface of the reusable coffee pod can be tightly combined with the brewing head of the machine to provide a more perfect pressure when brewing coffee. No More Coffee Splatter - We have noticed that the existing reusable k cups for ninja dual brew coffee maker have coffee spraying during use. After testing, we found that this is caused by the filtration speed of the coffee capsules being slower than the shower speed of the coffee brewing head. Therefore, we redesigned the area of the coffee capsule filter to re-adapt the coffee machine to the coffee capsule, and now the two are perfectly balanced! Perfect Compatibility - According to the coffee pod adapter of the original dual brew coffee maker, accurate mold opening, truly compatible with Ninja CFP200, CFP300, CFP301(c), CFP305, CFP307, CFP451 and CFP400 Dualbrew Pro System Coffee maker. Reusable k cup coffee capsules will help you save a lot of money! This capsule is only compatible with ‘three hole’ coffee machine, please confirm your coffee machine model before purchasing! Strict Quality Control - All reusable coffee capsule for ninja coffee maker manufacturing processes are large assembly line production, food-grade materials, food-grade 304 stainless steel, BPA-free, durable and safe. You will get 4* reusable coffee pods compatible with Ninja Dual Brew Coffee Maker to make different flavors of coffee for your family and friends. We strive to provide unmatched customer service and support. If you are not satisfied with our products or have quality problems, please contact us and we will provide kindly service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Xq1Ru7BVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIUDANGKA","source_asin":"B0B7HQPLHJ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-83979","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7HQPLHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7HQPLHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
